# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Code Assistant LLMs aim to make quantum computing more accessible to new Qiskit adopters and to improve the coding experience for current users. It is trained using millions of text tokens from Qiskit SDK, years of Qiskit code examples, and IBM Quantum&reg; features. Qiskit Code Assistant can help your quantum development workflow by offering LLM-generated suggestions based on [IBM Granite and other open-source models](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), which incorporate the latest features and functionalities from IBM&reg;.\n"
msgstr "LLM Qiskit Code Assistant bertujuan membuat komputasi kuantum lebih mudah diakses oleh pengguna Qiskit baru dan meningkatkan pengalaman coding bagi pengguna saat ini. Asisten ini dilatih menggunakan jutaan token teks dari Qiskit SDK, bertahun-tahun contoh kode Qiskit, dan fitur-fitur IBM Quantum&reg;. Qiskit Code Assistant bisa membantu alur kerja pengembangan kuantummu dengan menawarkan saran yang dihasilkan LLM berdasarkan [model IBM Granite dan model open-source lainnya](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), yang mencakup fitur dan fungsionalitas terbaru dari IBM&reg;.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- **Want to skip to the installation instructions? Go to the [Install Qiskit Code Assistant](#install) section.**\n"
"- If you have feedback or want to contact the developer team, use the [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) or the related public GitHub repositories.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"- **Ingin langsung ke petunjuk instalasi? Buka bagian [Instal Qiskit Code Assistant](#install).**\n"
"- Kalau kamu punya masukan atau ingin menghubungi tim pengembang, gunakan [saluran Qiskit Slack Workspace](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) atau repositori GitHub publik terkait.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Large Language Model (LLM) behind Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Large Language Model (LLM) di balik Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To provide code suggestions, Qiskit Code Assistant uses a Large Language Model (LLM). In this case, Qiskit Code Assistant currently relies on the model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, built on the [Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit model](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit). The `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model improves the `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` model's code generation capabilities for Qiskit through extended pretraining and fine-tuning it on high-quality Qiskit data, as well as Python commits and chat. For more information about the Mistral AI models family, refer to [Mistral AI documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). For more details about the `.*-qiskit` models, see [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training LLMs for generating Quantum Computing Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"
msgstr "Untuk memberikan saran kode, Qiskit Code Assistant menggunakan Large Language Model (LLM). Dalam hal ini, Qiskit Code Assistant saat ini mengandalkan model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, yang dibangun di atas [model Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit). Model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` meningkatkan kemampuan pembuatan kode model `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` untuk Qiskit melalui pelatihan tambahan yang diperluas dan fine-tuning pada data Qiskit berkualitas tinggi, serta commit Python dan chat. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang keluarga model Mistral AI, lihat [dokumentasi Mistral AI](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). Untuk detail lebih lanjut tentang model `.*-qiskit`, lihat [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training LLMs for generating Quantum Computing Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our LLMs specialized for Qiskit are available also as open-source models. Check all the models available at https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"
msgstr "LLM yang kami khususkan untuk Qiskit juga tersedia sebagai model open-source. Lihat semua model yang tersedia di https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmarks {#the-qiskit-humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"
msgstr "Benchmark Qiskit HumanEval dan Qiskit HumanEval Hard {#the-qiskit-humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To test the `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` and other models, we collaborated with Qiskit Advocates and experts to create the execution-based benchmarks called Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) and Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), and ran them on the models. These benchmarks are similar to [HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), including multiple challenging code problems to solve, all based on the official Qiskit libraries.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menguji `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` dan model lainnya, kami berkolaborasi dengan Qiskit Advocates dan para ahli untuk membuat benchmark berbasis eksekusi yang disebut Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) dan Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), lalu menjalankannya pada model-model tersebut. Benchmark ini mirip dengan [HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), mencakup berbagai masalah kode yang menantang untuk diselesaikan, semuanya berbasis library Qiskit resmi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The benchmarks are composed of approximately 150 tests, each one made from a function definition, followed by a docstring that details the task the model is required to solve. Each example also includes a reference canonical solution, as well as unit tests, to evaluate the correctness of the generated solutions. There are three levels of difficulty for tests: basic, intermediate, and difficult. The Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmark is a variation of the Qiskit HumanEval one, but removes information related to code imports, so the LLM needs to figure out the right method or class imports. This change makes the dataset much more challenging for LLMs, according to our tests and initial results.\n"
msgstr "Benchmark ini terdiri dari sekitar 150 tes, masing-masing dibuat dari definisi fungsi, diikuti oleh docstring yang merinci tugas yang harus diselesaikan model. Setiap contoh juga mencakup solusi kanonik referensi, serta unit test, untuk mengevaluasi kebenaran solusi yang dihasilkan. Ada tiga tingkat kesulitan tes: dasar, menengah, dan sulit. Benchmark Qiskit HumanEval Hard adalah variasi dari Qiskit HumanEval, tetapi menghapus informasi terkait impor kode, sehingga LLM perlu mencari tahu impor metode atau kelas yang tepat. Perubahan ini membuat dataset jauh lebih menantang bagi LLM, menurut pengujian dan hasil awal kami.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The datasets for Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard are available at these websites: [Qiskit HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) and [Qiskit HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). You can contribute to the development of these benchmarks at the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"
msgstr "Dataset untuk Qiskit HumanEval dan Qiskit HumanEval Hard tersedia di situs-situs ini: [Qiskit HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) dan [Qiskit HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). Kamu bisa berkontribusi pada pengembangan benchmark ini di [repositori GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"

