# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to install, configure, and use any of Qiskit Code Assistant models on your local machine.\n"
msgstr "Pelajari cara menginstal, mengonfigurasi, dan menggunakan model Qiskit Code Assistant mana pun di mesin lokalmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Unduh dari situs web Hugging Face\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from the Hugging Face website:\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah ini untuk mengunduh model terkait Qiskit Code Assistant mana pun dari situs web Hugging Face:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to the desired Qiskit model page on Hugging Face.\n"
msgstr "Buka halaman model Qiskit yang diinginkan di Hugging Face.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to the **Files and Versions** tab and download the safetensors or GGUF model files.\n"
msgstr "Buka tab **Files and Versions** dan unduh file model safetensors atau GGUF.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr "</AccordionItem>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Unduh menggunakan Hugging Face CLI\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To download any of the available Qiskit Code Assistant models using the Hugging Face CLI, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengunduh model Qiskit Code Assistant yang tersedia menggunakan Hugging Face CLI, ikuti langkah-langkah ini:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [Hugging Face CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"
msgstr "Instal [Hugging Face CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to your Hugging Face account\n"
msgstr "Login ke akun Hugging Face-mu\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the model you prefer from the previous list\n"
msgstr "Unduh model yang kamu suka dari daftar sebelumnya\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Deploy model Qiskit Code Assistant secara lokal melalui Ollama secara manual\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using [Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr "Ada banyak cara untuk men-deploy dan berinteraksi dengan model Qiskit Code Assistant yang sudah diunduh. Panduan ini mendemonstrasikan penggunaan [Ollama](https://ollama.com) sebagai berikut: baik dengan [aplikasi Ollama](#using-the-ollama-application) menggunakan integrasi Hugging Face Hub atau model lokal, maupun dengan [paket `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-cpp-python).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Menggunakan aplikasi Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr "Aplikasi Ollama menyediakan solusi sederhana untuk menjalankan LLM secara lokal. Aplikasi ini mudah digunakan, dengan CLI yang membuat seluruh proses setup, manajemen model, dan interaksi cukup mudah. Ini ideal untuk eksperimen cepat dan untuk pengguna yang ingin menangani lebih sedikit detail teknis.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "Instal Ollama {#install-ollama}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "Unduh [aplikasi Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "Instal file yang telah diunduh\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Luncurkan aplikasi Ollama yang sudah terinstal\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        Aplikasi berjalan dengan sukses ketika ikon Ollama muncul di menu bar desktop. Kamu juga bisa memverifikasi layanan berjalan dengan membuka `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr "Coba Ollama di terminalmu dan mulai menjalankan model. Misalnya:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Ollama menggunakan integrasi Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-ollama-using-the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr "[Integrasi Ollama/Hugging Face Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) menyediakan cara untuk berinteraksi dengan model yang di-host di Hugging Face Hub tanpa perlu membuat modelfile baru atau mengunduh file GGUF atau safetensors secara manual. File `template` dan `params` default sudah disertakan untuk model di Hugging Face Hub.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan aplikasi Ollama sedang berjalan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr "Buka halaman model yang diinginkan, dan salin URL-nya. Misalnya, https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "Dari terminalmu, jalankan perintah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan model `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` atau salah satu model GGUF resmi lainnya yang saat ini direkomendasikan `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` atau `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Ollama dengan model GGUF Qiskit Code Assistant yang diunduh secara manual {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu sudah mengunduh model GGUF secara manual seperti https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF dan kamu ingin bereksperimen dengan template dan parameter yang berbeda, kamu bisa mengikuti langkah-langkah ini untuk memuatnya ke aplikasi Ollama lokalmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update `<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr "Buat sebuah `Modelfile` dengan memasukkan konten berikut dan pastikan memperbarui `<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` ke path sebenarnya dari model yang kamu unduh.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    ```\n"
msgstr "    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the following command to create a custom model instance based on the `Modelfile`.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut untuk membuat instance model kustom berdasarkan `Modelfile`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        This process may take some time for Ollama to read the model file, initialize the model instance, and configure it according to the specifications provided.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        Proses ini mungkin membutuhkan beberapa waktu agar Ollama bisa membaca file model, menginisialisasi instance model, dan mengonfigurasinya sesuai spesifikasi yang diberikan.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Qiskit Code Assistant model manually downloaded in Ollama"
msgstr "Jalankan model Qiskit Code Assistant yang diunduh secara manual di Ollama"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model has been set up in Ollama, run the following command to launch the model and interact with it in the terminal (in chat mode).\n"
msgstr "Setelah model `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` sudah disiapkan di Ollama, jalankan perintah berikut untuk meluncurkan model dan berinteraksi dengannya di terminal (dalam mode chat).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some useful commands:\n"
msgstr "Beberapa perintah yang berguna:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ollama list` - List models on your computer\n"
msgstr "`ollama list` - Daftar model di komputer Anda\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ollama rm Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Delete the model\n"
msgstr "`ollama rm Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Hapus model\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ollama show Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Show model information\n"
msgstr "`ollama show Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Tampilkan informasi model\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ollama stop Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Stop a model that is currently running\n"
msgstr "`ollama stop Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Hentikan model yang sedang berjalan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
