#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in local through the `llama-cpp-python` package\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Deploy model Qiskit Code Assistant secara lokal melalui paket `llama-cpp-python` secara manual\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"use-llama-cpp-python\"></span>\n"
"An alternative to the Ollama application is the `llama-cpp-python` package, which is a Python binding for `llama.cpp`. It gives you more control and flexibility to run the GGUF model locally, and is ideal for users who wish to integrate the local model in their workflows and Python applications.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install [`llama-cpp-python`](https://pypi.org/project/llama-cpp-python/)\n"
msgstr "Instal [`llama-cpp-python`](https://pypi.org/project/llama-cpp-python/)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Interact with the model from within your application using `llama_cpp`. For example:\n"
msgstr "Berinteraksi dengan model dari dalam aplikasi Anda menggunakan `llama_cpp`. Contohnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also add text generation parameters to the model to customize the inference:\n"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat menambahkan parameter pembuatan teks ke model untuk menyesuaikan inferensi:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in local through llama.cpp\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in local through llama.cpp\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `llama.cpp` library"
msgstr "Gunakan library `llama.cpp`"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another alternative is to use `llama.cpp`, an open-source library for performing LLM inference on a CPU with minimal setup.\n"
"It provides low-level control over the model execution and is typically run from the command line, pointing to a local GGUF model file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alternatif lain adalah menggunakan `llama.cpp`, sebuah library open-source untuk melakukan inferensi LLM pada CPU dengan pengaturan minimal.\n"
"Library ini menyediakan kontrol tingkat rendah atas eksekusi model dan biasanya dijalankan dari command line, menunjuk ke file model GGUF lokal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to install `llama.cpp` on your machine:\n"
msgstr "Ada beberapa cara untuk menginstal `llama.cpp` di komputer Anda:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install llama.cpp using [brew, nix, or winget](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/install.md)\n"
msgstr "Instal llama.cpp menggunakan [brew, nix, atau winget](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/install.md)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run with Docker: See out the [Docker documentation by `llama.cpp` team](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/docker.md)\n"
msgstr "Jalankan dengan Docker: Lihat [dokumentasi Docker oleh tim `llama.cpp`](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/docker.md)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download pre-built binaries from the [releases page](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases)\n"
msgstr "Unduh binari yang sudah dibangun dari [halaman releases](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build from source by [cloning this repository](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/build.md)\n"
msgstr "Bangun dari source dengan [meng-clone repository ini](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/build.md)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once installed, you can use `llama.cpp` to interact with GGUF models in conversation mode as follows:\n"
msgstr "Setelah terinstal, Anda dapat menggunakan `llama.cpp` untuk berinteraksi dengan model GGUF dalam mode percakapan sebagai berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also launch an OpenAI-compatible API server for the model in the following way:\n"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat meluncurkan server API yang kompatibel dengan OpenAI untuk model dengan cara berikut:\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced parameters"
msgstr "Parameter lanjutan"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the `llama-cli` program, you can control the model generation using command-line options. For example, you can provide an initial “system” prompt using the `-p/--prompt` flag. In conversation mode (`-cnv`), this initial prompt acts as the system message. Otherwise, you can simply prepend any desired instruction to your prompt text. You can also adjust sampling parameters - for instance: temperature (`--temp`), top-k (`--top-k`), top-p (`--top-p`), repetition penalty (`--repeat-penalty`), and the seed to use (`--seed`). The following is an example invocation using these options:\n"
msgstr "Dengan program `llama-cli`, Anda dapat mengontrol pembuatan model menggunakan opsi command-line. Misalnya, Anda dapat memberikan prompt \"sistem\" awal menggunakan flag `-p/--prompt`. Dalam mode percakapan (`-cnv`), prompt awal ini bertindak sebagai pesan sistem. Jika tidak, Anda cukup menambahkan instruksi yang diinginkan di depan teks prompt Anda. Anda juga dapat menyesuaikan parameter sampling - misalnya: temperature (`--temp`), top-k (`--top-k`), top-p (`--top-p`), repetition penalty (`--repeat-penalty`), dan seed yang digunakan (`--seed`). Berikut adalah contoh pemanggilan menggunakan opsi-opsi ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To ensure proper functionality of our Qiskit models, we recommend using the system prompt provided in our HF GGUF repositories: system prompt for [mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system), [Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system), [granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system), and [granite-3.2-8b-qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/granite-3.2-8b-qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system).\n"
msgstr "Untuk memastikan fungsionalitas yang tepat dari model Qiskit kami, kami merekomendasikan menggunakan system prompt yang disediakan di repository HF GGUF kami: system prompt untuk [mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system), [Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system), [granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system), dan [granite-3.2-8b-qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/granite-3.2-8b-qiskit-GGUF/blob/main/system).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Manually connect Continue (VS Code)\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Hubungkan Continue (VS Code) secara manual\">\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Continue](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Continue.continue) (VS Code)"
msgstr "[Continue](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Continue.continue) (VS Code)"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install the extension"
msgstr "1. Instal ekstensi"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open VS Code, go to Extensions (`Cmd+Shift+X`), search **Continue**, install it.\n"
msgstr "Buka VS Code, buka Extensions (`Cmd+Shift+X`), cari **Continue**, instal.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Open the config"
msgstr "2. Buka konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the Continue icon in the sidebar, then click the gear icon, or open the command palette (`Cmd+Shift+P`) and run **Continue: Open Config File**.\n"
msgstr "Klik ikon Continue di sidebar, lalu klik ikon gear, atau buka command palette (`Cmd+Shift+P`) dan jalankan **Continue: Open Config File**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This opens `~/.continue/config.yaml` (or `config.json` in older versions).\n"
msgstr "Ini akan membuka `~/.continue/config.yaml` (atau `config.json` di versi lama).\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Configure the model"
msgstr "3. Konfigurasi model"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the following to `config.yaml`:\n"
msgstr "Tambahkan yang berikut ke `config.yaml`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This makes the Qiskit model available in the **chat panel** (sidebar conversations, inline Q&A) and for **inline edit** commands.\n"
msgstr "Ini membuat model Qiskit tersedia di **panel chat** (percakapan sidebar, tanya jawab inline) dan untuk perintah **inline edit**.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Test it"
msgstr "4. Test it"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Chat:** Open the Continue panel in the sidebar and ask a question (e.g., \"How do I create a parameterized circuit in Qiskit?\")\n"
msgstr "**Chat:** Buka panel Continue di sidebar dan ajukan pertanyaan (misalnya, \"Bagaimana cara membuat circuit yang diparameterisasi di Qiskit?\")\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Inline edit:** Select a block of code, press `Cmd+I` (Mac) or `Ctrl+I` (Linux/Windows)\n"
msgstr "**Inline edit:** Pilih blok kode, tekan `Cmd+I` (Mac) atau `Ctrl+I` (Linux/Windows)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Manually connect Jupyter AI (JupyterLab)\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Hubungkan Jupyter AI (JupyterLab) secara manual\">\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Jupyter AI](https://jupyter-ai.readthedocs.io/en/v3/index.html) (JupyterLab)"
msgstr "[Jupyter AI](https://jupyter-ai.readthedocs.io/en/v3/index.html) (JupyterLab)"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** These instructions cover Jupyter AI v2.x.\n"
msgstr "**Catatan:** Instruksi ini mencakup Jupyter AI v2.x.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install Jupyter AI and the Ollama provider"
msgstr "1. Instal Jupyter AI dan provider Ollama"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `\"jupyter-ai<3\"` pin ensures you get v2.x. The `langchain-ollama` package is required for Jupyter AI to detect Ollama as a provider. Without it, Ollama will not appear in the settings panel.\n"
msgstr "Pin `\"jupyter-ai<3\"` memastikan Anda mendapatkan v2.x. Paket `langchain-ollama` diperlukan agar Jupyter AI dapat mendeteksi Ollama sebagai provider. Tanpa itu, Ollama tidak akan muncul di panel pengaturan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then restart JupyterLab.\n"
msgstr "Kemudian restart JupyterLab.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Configure the chat model"
msgstr "2. Konfigurasi model chat"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open JupyterLab and click the **chat icon** in the left sidebar. In the settings panel:\n"
msgstr "Buka JupyterLab dan klik **ikon chat** di sidebar kiri. Di panel pengaturan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Under **Language model**, select **Ollama** as the provider.\n"
msgstr "Di bawah **Language model**, pilih **Ollama** sebagai provider.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` as the model name.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` sebagai nama model.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "No API key is needed for Ollama (leave the field empty).\n"
msgstr "Tidak diperlukan API key untuk Ollama (biarkan field kosong).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the back arrow to start chatting.\n"
msgstr "Klik panah kembali untuk mulai chatting.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Use the `%%ai` magic command"
msgstr "3. Gunakan perintah magic `%%ai`"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `%%ai` magic lets you query the model directly in notebook cells.\n"
msgstr "Magic `%%ai` memungkinkan Anda melakukan query ke model langsung di cell notebook.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then in a cell:\n"
msgstr "Kemudian di sebuah cell:\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Custom Ollama host (optional)"
msgstr "4. Host Ollama kustom (opsional)"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, Jupyter AI connects to `http://127.0.0.1:11434`. If your Ollama server runs on a different address or port:\n"
msgstr "Secara default, Jupyter AI terhubung ke `http://127.0.0.1:11434`. Jika server Ollama Anda berjalan di alamat atau port yang berbeda:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**In the chat UI:** Set the \"Base API URL\" field in the AI settings panel.\n"
msgstr "**Di UI chat:** Atur field \"Base API URL\" di panel pengaturan AI.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Manually connect OpenCode (Terminal)\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Hubungkan OpenCode (Terminal) secara manual\">\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "[OpenCode](https://opencode.ai/) (Terminal)"
msgstr "[OpenCode](https://opencode.ai/) (Terminal)"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Install OpenCode"
msgstr "1. Instal OpenCode"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Configure the Qiskit model"
msgstr "2. Konfigurasi model Qiskit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an `opencode.json` file in your project root (or `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` for a global config):\n"
msgstr "Buat file `opencode.json` di root proyek Anda (atau `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` untuk konfigurasi global):\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Select the model"
msgstr "3. Pilih model"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launch OpenCode in your project directory:\n"
msgstr "Jalankan OpenCode di direktori proyek Anda:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inside the TUI, run the `/models` command and select **Qiskit Code Assistant** from the list.\n"
msgstr "Di dalam TUI, jalankan perintah `/models` dan pilih **Qiskit Code Assistant** dari daftar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ask a question directly in the chat, for example: \"Define a Bell circuit and run it using QiskitRuntimeService\"\n"
msgstr "Ajukan pertanyaan langsung di chat, misalnya: \"Definisikan circuit Bell dan jalankan menggunakan QiskitRuntimeService\"\n"

